# the IR and code generator of the mach toolchain, as a library
#
# this is mirl's one declared public list: every module a dependent imports
# is forwarded here, and every other module of src is internal to mirl and
# may change without notice. a dependent imports a module by its own path, so
# the list is held by review, as nothing in the build enforces it. a module
# joins the list when a dependent first imports it and leaves it when the
# last one stops. a name two modules share takes its parent's name here, which
# no dependent reads.

use std.runtime;

fwd mirl.base.slice;
fwd mirl.base.stats;
fwd mirl.build.builder;
